# Deploy trigger

When the user says **deploy**, **release**, **publish**, or **ship** the Windows app update:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/deploy-windows/SKILL.md`
2. Run the full sequence (do not only give instructions):

```bash
npm version patch --no-git-tag-version    # 1.8.1 → 1.8.2 (bug fixes)
# or
npm version minor --no-git-tag-version    # 1.8.x → 1.9.0 (new features)

git add .
git commit -m "changes"
git push origin main

npm run dist:win -- --publish always
```

Default to **patch** unless the user asks for **minor**. Report the new version and publish result when done.
